[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    63[0m:[38;5;10m[49m undefined behaviour there and so has no "expected result" to match:
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    64[0m:[38;5;10m[49m `h2 == NULL`, or `h2`/`h1` shorter than 3 bytes when the corresponding bytes are
