[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     11[0m:[38;5;10m[49m //! * rows 3–4 are strict subsets of row 1 and are asserted as such (and re-run
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     12[0m:[38;5;10m[49m //!   explicitly, since a subset test that is cheap to run is cheap to keep).
